  <channel>
    <title>[MC-NBFX]: .NET Binary Format: XML Data Structure</title>
    <link>https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/openspecs/windows_protocols/MC-NBFX/94c66ea1-e79a-4364-af88-1fa7fef2cc33</link>
    <description>Specifies the XML data structure for the .NET Binary Format for XML. This format can represent many XML documents, as specified in [XML1.0]. The purpose of the format is to reduce the processing costs associated with XML documents by encoding an XML document in fewer bytes than the same document encoded in UTF-8, as specified in [RFC2279].</description>
